      "writtenOn": "2025-04-30T21:53:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t *think* this works because in `prepareMappedBindBuffer` if the buffer overflows, you still need the offset. I\u0027ve change it to returning a pair with both?",
